{"id":"a36ff62aa04d500e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance.md","title":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance — seven tuple tm acceptance","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance — seven tuple tm acceptance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance — seven tuple tm acceptance","depends_on":["[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]","[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]","[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance","73-definition-7.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance — seven tuple tm acceptance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5878cb4e5741b073\" href=\"?note=5878cb4e5741b073\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab975c5a8c0c0424\" href=\"?note=ab975c5a8c0c0424\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance</span><span>73-definition-7.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；配置与运行见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5878cb4e5741b073\" href=\"?note=5878cb4e5741b073\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab975c5a8c0c0424\" href=\"?note=ab975c5a8c0c0424\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\">\\(M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\">\\(M\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\)</span> 为接受谓词的两个原排版接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(w)\\downarrow\">\\(M(w)\\downarrow\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(w)\\uparrow\">\\(M(w)\\uparrow\\)</span> 指停机与不停机。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\">\\(\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\)</span> 是下述终态词输出图，不把无输出的计算当作普通函数值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{init}}:\\Sigma^*\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\times\\mathbb Z\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{init}}:\\Sigma^*\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\times\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 是下述定义的初始配置映射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{init}\">\\(\\mathrm{init}\\)</span> 为其角色下标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(u\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j\">\\(\\pi_j\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的元组投影，终态见证始终取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nT_w(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(n),&amp;0\\le n&lt;|w|,\\\\\\sqcup,&amp;n&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le n,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nC_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\coloneqq(q_0,T_w,0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nT_w(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(n),&amp;0\\le n&lt;|w|,\\\\\\sqcup,&amp;n&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le n,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nC_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\coloneqq(q_0,T_w,0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\\land\\pi_1(C)=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\\land\\pi_1(C)=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\leftrightarrow M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w,\\qquad\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\,w\\leftrightarrow M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w,\\qquad\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM(w)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\bigr),\\qquad\nM(w)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow\\neg(M(w)\\downarrow)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nM(w)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\bigr),\\qquad\nM(w)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow\\neg(M(w)\\downarrow)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\leftrightarrow\nu\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\Bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|u|\\}\\;(\\pi_2(C))(i)=u(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|u|\\}\\;(\\pi_2(C))(i)=\\sqcup\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\leftrightarrow\nu\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\;\n\\Bigl(C_{\\mathrm{init}}(w)\\vdash_M^*C\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|u|\\}\\;(\\pi_2(C))(i)=u(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|u|\\}\\;(\\pi_2(C))(i)=\\sqcup\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"5878cb4e5741b073","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition","status":"resolved","id":"ab975c5a8c0c0424","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"5878cb4e5741b073","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\